            <ArticleTitle>Familial Transmission of emm12 Group A Streptococcus.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1745-1746</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3201/eid2310.170343</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Incidence and severity of invasive group A Streptococcus infections are of increasing concern in France and worldwide. The risk for secondary infection of close contacts is known but rarely described. We report a case of intrafamilial and life-threatening transmission of emm12 group A Streptococcus.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
